# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3631 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_0c0e7952:
msgid "[_MG_] Yeah, but a school board hearing would make this all very public, and I think people's imaginations will make them believe that much more is going on between you and [ryan]."
msgstr "[_MG_] Oui, mais une audience du conseil scolaire rendrait tout cela très public, et je pense que l'imagination des gens leur fera croire qu'il se passe beaucoup plus entre vous et [ryan]."

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3632 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_16f9504e:
msgid "[_MT_] {i}Dammit! That could ruin both of our reputations. We would probably have to move. But I'm sure the FBI wouldn't let us.{/i}"
msgstr "[_MT_] {i}Bon sang! Cela pourrait ruiner nos deux réputations. Nous devrions probablement déménager. Mais je suis sûr que le FBI ne nous laisserait pas faire.{/i}"

# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:3633 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_mom_blackmailed_a0c0702c:
msgid "[_MG_] Don't get too defensive until you hear what it is that I want."
