# game/Gallery_labels_AFV-0.06_v0.2.rpy:34325 #-#-# translate crowdin label_gal_girl_time_club_eecd6d7e:
msgid "[_M_] Lauren, on the other hand, was a walking disaster! Always needing help with school, and picking fights with the other girls. I still worry about her plans for the future."
